  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study of Pharm-Grade Warehouse Project in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the support from Ministry of Health and Global Fund, the project aims to carry out an integral, systematic, and comprehensive assessment (a feasibility study) of the pharmaceutical warehouse, in terms of construction, operations and financial sustainability, meeting international standards, considering not only the current operational needs but also include provisions for emergency scenarios and anticipated growth over the next two decades.</narrative>
  </description>
